# A built native library goes here; see rust/README.md.
#
# Build artefacts are not committed: they are platform-specific, they are
# large, and a stale one committed by accident would be loaded in preference
# to a freshly built one. This file exists so the directory does, so that the
# loader has somewhere to look and the build has somewhere to copy to.
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
